  {
    "id": 2021006110140,
    "speaker": "円香",
    "text": "何も問題ないと、\r\nすました顔をしていれば",
    "charAnim1": "smile2",
    "charAnim2": "face_wait",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_wait",
    "charLabel": "madoka",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "charPosition": {
      "x": 568,
      "y": 640,
      "order": 0
    },
    "charEffect": {
      "type": "to",
      "alpha": 1,
      "time": 100
    },
    "voice": "produce_events/202100611/2021006110140"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "うーむ\r\n俺は本当に問題なかったんだけど",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 2021006110150,
    "speaker": "円香",
    "text": "まあ、それでも耳は赤いままですが",
    "charAnim1": "wait2",
    "charAnim2": "face_close",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_wait",
    "charLabel": "madoka",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/202100611/2021006110150"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "ほ、本当に、本当の話なのか……？",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 2021006110160,
    "speaker": "円香",
    "text": "さあ？　どうでしょうね",
    "charAnim1": "surp2",
    "charAnim2": "face_wait",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_wait",
    "charLabel": "madoka",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/202100611/2021006110160"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "……",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "よし、そうやってからかう気なら\r\n俺だってちょっとは反撃するぞ",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "円香の方こそ取り繕えていなかった時、\r\nあったと思うけどなあ……？",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 2021006110170,
    "speaker": "円香",
    "text": "そうでしたか",
    "charAnim1": "sad2",
    "charAnim2": "face_close",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_wait",
    "charLabel": "madoka",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/202100611/2021006110170"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "………………",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "いつのことか聞いてくれないと",
    "charAnim2": "face_wait",
    "charLabel": "madoka",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 2021006110180,
    "speaker": "円香",
    "text": "私からは聞きませんので、\r\nどうぞご自由にお話ください",
    "charAnim1": "anger1",
    "charAnim2": "face_wait",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_wait",
    "charLabel": "madoka",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/202100611/2021006110180"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "そ、そう言われると話しにくいが……",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "シャワー室での悲鳴はどうなんだ？\r\nあれは円香の隙じゃないのか",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 2021006110190,
    "speaker": "円香",
    "text": "そうですね\r\n虫は苦手なもので",
    "charAnim1": "smile2",
    "charAnim2": "face_wait",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_wait",
    "charLabel": "madoka",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/202100611/2021006110190"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "く……\r\n事も無げに……",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
